**Given:**

Fraction percentage = frac{{75}}{{17}} %

**Concept used:**

Percentage: - By a certain percent, we mean that many hundredths. Thus, x% means x hundredths, written as x%

To express x% as a fraction: We have, x% = frac{{x}}{{100}} 

**Calculation:**

⇒ frac{{75}}{{17}} % = frac{{75}}{{17}times 100} 

⇒ frac{{3}}{{68}}
